sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GS as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Orchestrator as Orchestrator Core<br/>Task Dispatch
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Service<br/>8080/TCP REST
    participant TGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI-Compatible Svc<br/>REST

    Note over Client,OpenAI: Flow 1: Unary Text Generation with Detection

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Passthrough Headers
    GS->>Orchestrator: ClassificationWithGenTask
    Orchestrator->>Chunker: Chunk input text<br/>gRPC, TLS optional
    Chunker-->>Orchestrator: Text chunks
    Orchestrator->>Detector: Detect content safety<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token optional
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>TGIS: Generate text<br/>gRPC, TLS configurable
    TGIS-->>Orchestrator: Generated text
    Orchestrator->>Detector: Detect on generated text<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator-->>GS: Combined result
    GS-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,OpenAI: Flow 2: Streaming Content Detection (NDJSON)

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/text/detection/stream-content<br/>NDJSON over HTTP/HTTPS
    GS->>Orchestrator: StreamContentDetectionTask
    loop For each chunk in stream
        Orchestrator->>Detector: Detect content<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        Detector-->>Orchestrator: Detection result
        Orchestrator-->>GS: NDJSON line
        GS-->>Client: NDJSON line
    end

    Note over Client,OpenAI: Flow 3: OpenAI Chat Completions with Detection

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Passthrough Headers
    GS->>Orchestrator: ChatCompletionsDetectionTask
    Orchestrator->>Detector: Detect input content<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: Input detection results
    Orchestrator->>OpenAI: Chat completion request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token optional
    OpenAI-->>Orchestrator: Completion response (or SSE stream)
    Orchestrator->>Detector: Detect output content<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: Output detection results
    Orchestrator-->>GS: Combined response (JSON or SSE)
    GS-->>Client: Response with [DONE] sentinel (if streaming)
